---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Wireless Smart Lighting Control | Blutech" description="Blutech wireless smart lighting combines local BLE sensing and control, 0–10V dimming, locally stored schedules, central monitoring and BMS/API integration." canonicalPath="/products/wireless-smart-lighting">
  <section class="ls-hero">
    <div class="shell ls-grid">
      <div class="ls-copy"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>›</span><a href="/products">Products</a><span>›</span><span>Smart Lighting</span></div><div class="kicker">New lighting solution</div><h1>Smarter lighting.<br/>Better buildings.</h1><p>Responsive local control for people and daylight, with the visibility and integration landlords expect from a modern building system.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button light" href="/contact?solution=smart-lighting">Discuss a lighting retrofit</a><a class="quiet" href="#architecture">See architecture ↓</a></div></div>
      <div class="ls-scene" aria-hidden="true"><div class="room-lines"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="scene-caption"><span>LOCAL INTELLIGENCE</span><strong>Immediate response without a cloud round trip.</strong></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="value-strip"><div class="shell values"><div><b>BLE</b><span>Local wireless control</span></div><div><b>0–10V</b><span>Dimming output</span></div><div><b>PIR + Lux</b><span>Occupancy & daylight logic</span></div><div><b>Local schedules</b><span>Continues through temporary outages</span></div><div><b>BMS / API</b><span>Central integration</span></div></div></section>

  <section class="functions"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">How it works</div><h2>Keep fast decisions local. Keep management central.</h2><p>The field-control path is deliberately separated from the management path, so routine lighting response does not depend on cloud connectivity.</p></div></div><div class="function-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Occupancy response</h3><p>PIR events can trigger an assigned lighting group locally over BLE and return it to a standby scene after a configurable time-out.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Daylight response</h3><p>Lux thresholds can switch representative daylight zones between configured scenes without a lux sensor on every circuit.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Schedules</h3><p>Daily and weekly schedules are downloaded to the gateway for local execution during temporary communication outages.</p></article><article><span>04</span><h3>FM control</h3><p>Authorised operators can configure groups, scenes, time-outs, thresholds, schedules and temporary overrides centrally.</p></article></div></div></section>

  <section class="architecture" id="architecture"><div class="shell"><div class="architecture-head"><div><div class="kicker">System architecture</div><h2>Wireless where it helps. Open where it matters.</h2></div><p>Retrofit-oriented field control with an integration path to the wider building.</p></div><div class="arch-board"><div class="arch-row"><span>LOCAL CONTROL</span><div><b>PIR / Lux</b><small>Sensor event</small></div><em>→</em><div><b>BLE network</b><small>Wireless field link</small></div><em>→</em><div><b>Lighting controller</b><small>Scene logic</small></div><em>→</em><div class="invert"><b>0–10V driver</b><small>Light output</small></div></div><div class="arch-rule"></div><div class="arch-row"><span>MANAGEMENT</span><div><b>Gateway</b><small>Schedules & status</small></div><em>→</em><div><b>IP / 4G backhaul</b><small>Project network</small></div><em>→</em><div><b>Blutech platform</b><small>Monitor & configure</small></div><em>→</em><div><b>BMS / API</b><small>Integrate</small></div></div></div></div></section>

  <section class="operator"><div class="shell operator-grid"><div><div class="kicker">For FM teams</div><h2>One place to configure, operate and review.</h2></div><div class="operator-list"><div><b>Configure</b><p>Lighting groups, scene mapping, PIR time-out, lux thresholds and daily / weekly schedules.</p></div><div><b>Operate</b><p>Manual override, scene selection and temporary area control.</p></div><div><b>Monitor</b><p>Gateway and device status, sensor events, current scene and communication alarms.</p></div><div><b>Review & integrate</b><p>Historical events, alarms and agreed BMS/API points for the wider building-management layer.</p></div></div></div></section>

  <section class="applications"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">Applications</div><h2>Built for retrofit-heavy premium buildings.</h2></div></div><div class="application-grid"><div><h3>Lift lobbies</h3><p>Motion, schedules and independently controlled lighting groups.</p></div><div><h3>Corridors</h3><p>Wireless occupancy response across long or irregular floorplates.</p></div><div><h3>Main lobbies</h3><p>Daylight-responsive scenes using representative lux sensing.</p></div><div><h3>Public & outdoor areas</h3><p>Scheduled and sensor-based operation with project-appropriate hardware and installation.</p></div></div></div></section>

  <section class="ls-cta"><div class="shell cta"><div><div class="kicker">Start with the space</div><h2>Show us the reflected ceiling plan.</h2><p>We can work from the zoning, luminaire/driver interface, ceiling conditions and integration requirement to define the control architecture.</p></div><a class="button light" href="/contact?solution=smart-lighting">Discuss the lighting solution</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.ls-hero{background:#111315;color:#fff;padding:0}.ls-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.82fr 1.18fr;min-height:650px}.ls-copy{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:70px 70px 70px 0}.ls-copy .breadcrumb,.ls-copy .breadcrumb a{color:#a9b0b3}.ls-copy .kicker{color:#76d5dc}.ls-copy h1{font-size:clamp(55px,6vw,86px);line-height:.94;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:12px 0 25px}.ls-copy>p{font-size:21px;line-height:1.4;color:#c4c9cb;max-width:620px}.hero-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;margin-top:30px}.button.light{background:#fff;color:#111;border-color:#fff}.quiet{font-size:13px;font-weight:800;border-bottom:1px solid #fff}.ls-scene{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3d3a34,#181a1b);border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12)}.room-lines{position:absolute;inset:8% 7% 23%;perspective:800px}.room-lines i{display:block;height:6px;background:#ffe7b8;box-shadow:0 0 22px rgba(255,229,177,.45);margin:8.5% 0;transform:rotate(-3deg) perspective(400px) rotateY(-7deg)}.scene-caption{position:absolute;left:8%;bottom:8%;border-left:2px solid #70d4dc;padding-left:16px}.scene-caption span,.scene-caption strong{display:block}.scene-caption span{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#79d7df;font-weight:900}.scene-caption strong{font-size:18px;margin-top:5px}.value-strip{padding:0;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr)}.values>div{padding:24px 20px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}.values>div:first-child{border-left:1px solid var(--line)}.values b,.values span{display:block}.values b{font-size:20px}.values span{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px}.functions{background:#f7f7f4}.function-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.function-grid article{padding:25px 25px 10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.function-grid article+article{padding-left:25px;border-left:1px solid var(--line)}.function-grid span{font-size:10px;color:var(--brand-2);font-weight:900}.function-grid h3{font-size:23px;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:9px 0}.function-grid p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}.architecture{background:#fff}.architecture-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:50px;margin-bottom:32px}.architecture-head h2{font-size:clamp(40px,4.8vw,64px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:8px 0 0}.architecture-head p{max-width:400px;color:var(--muted)}.arch-board{background:#151718;color:#fff;padding:40px}.arch-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:120px 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:center}.arch-row>span{font-size:9px;color:#7dd8df;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:900}.arch-row>div{min-height:95px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.17);padding:15px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}.arch-row b,.arch-row small{display:block}.arch-row b{font-size:14px}.arch-row small{font-size:9px;color:#aeb4b6}.arch-row em{font-style:normal;color:#6f787b}.arch-row .invert{background:#fff;color:#111}.arch-row .invert small{color:#666}.arch-rule{height:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.14);margin:30px 0}.operator{background:#efefeb}.operator-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:80px}.operator h2{font-size:clamp(40px,4.7vw,62px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:9px 0}.operator-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.operator-list>div{padding:22px 22px 15px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.operator-list>div:nth-child(even){padding-left:22px;border-left:1px solid var(--line)}.operator-list b{font-size:16px}.operator-list p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.applications{background:#fff}.application-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line)}.application-grid>div{background:#f7f7f4;padding:28px;min-height:180px}.application-grid h3{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 10px}.application-grid p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}.ls-cta{background:#101213;color:#fff}.cta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:60px}.ls-cta .kicker{color:#76d5dc}.ls-cta h2{font-size:clamp(40px,5vw,66px);letter-spacing:-.05em;line-height:1;margin:9px 0 12px}.ls-cta p{color:#b9c0c2;max-width:700px}
@media(max-width:900px){.ls-grid,.operator-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.ls-copy{padding-right:0}.ls-scene{min-height:480px;border-left:0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12)}.values,.function-grid,.application-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.arch-row{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.arch-row>span{grid-column:1/-1}.arch-row em{display:none}.cta,.architecture-head{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}}
@media(max-width:600px){.ls-copy{padding:55px 0}.ls-copy h1{font-size:49px}.ls-scene{min-height:360px}.values,.function-grid,.application-grid,.operator-list{grid-template-columns:1fr}.function-grid article+article,.operator-list>div:nth-child(even){padding-left:0;border-left:0}.arch-board{padding:24px 18px}.arch-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}.shell{width:min(var(--max),calc(100% - 36px))}}
</style>